<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-χρίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anoint, besmear,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχρίοντες ἀλοιφῇ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τόξον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.179
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶτ᾽ ἀπονιψαμένη καὶ ἐπιχρίσασα
					παρειάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.172
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶτ᾽ ἀπονίπτεσθαι καὶ
				ἐπιχρίεσθαι ἀλοιφῇ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				179
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>plaster over,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> with a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lay on</i> ointment, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ τὸ -χρισθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zopyr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				14.58.1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροτάφοις -χριόμενα</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.22
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλὸν ἐπὶ τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
					9.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.966
			</span></i> (Rome, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>use for anointing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.270
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
